WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.065 --> 00:00:05.474
To release something later, set its publish date in the future.

2
00:00:05.474 --> 00:00:07.152
The button changes to Schedule.

3
00:00:12.631 --> 00:00:15.337
Schedule it, and it goes live on its own at that time.

4
00:00:19.093 --> 00:00:22.101
To take something down, switch it to Draft and update.

5
00:00:22.101 --> 00:00:24.273
It leaves the app, but nothing is lost.

6
00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:39.290
Avoid the trash unless you're sure. Draft keeps it ready to bring back.
